&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div></description></item><item><title>如何删除除了Master之外的所有分支</title><link>https://mizuka-wu.github.io/posts/%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E5%88%A0%E9%99%A4%E9%99%A4%E4%BA%86master%E4%B9%8B%E5%A4%96%E7%9A%84%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E5%88%86%E6%94%AF/</link><pubDate>Wed, 05 Jun 2019 11:41:57 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://mizuka-wu.github.io/posts/%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E5%88%A0%E9%99%A4%E9%99%A4%E4%BA%86master%E4%B9%8B%E5%A4%96%E7%9A%84%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E5%88%86%E6%94%AF/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="如何删除除了master之外的所有分支">如何删除除了Master之外的所有分支&lt;/h2>
&lt;ol>
&lt;li>
&lt;p>切换到 master&lt;/p>
&lt;/li>
&lt;li>
