&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>git stash &lt;span style="color:#f92672">&amp;amp;&amp;amp;&lt;/span> git checkout master &lt;span style="color:#f92672">&amp;amp;&amp;amp;&lt;/span> git branch | grep -v &lt;span style="color:#e6db74">&amp;#34;master&amp;#34;&lt;/span> | xargs git branch -D
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div></description></item><item><title>electron开机自动启动</title><link>https://mizuka-wu.github.io/posts/electron%E5%BC%80%E6%9C%BA%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A8%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8/</link><pubDate>Mon, 11 Feb 2019 11:41:57 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://mizuka-wu.github.io/posts/electron%E5%BC%80%E6%9C%BA%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A8%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8/</guid><description>&lt;p>直接&lt;/p>
&lt;p>直接上&lt;/p>
&lt;p>直接上代码&lt;/p>
