&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>}
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div></description></item><item><title>html上实现div按照宽高比自适应</title><link>https://mizuka-wu.github.io/posts/html%E4%B8%8A%E5%AE%9E%E7%8E%B0div%E6%8C%89%E7%85%A7%E5%AE%BD%E9%AB%98%E6%AF%94%E8%87%AA%E9%80%82%E5%BA%94/</link><pubDate>Sun, 25 Nov 2018 09:40:02 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://mizuka-wu.github.io/posts/html%E4%B8%8A%E5%AE%9E%E7%8E%B0div%E6%8C%89%E7%85%A7%E5%AE%BD%E9%AB%98%E6%AF%94%E8%87%AA%E9%80%82%E5%BA%94/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="html-上实现-div-按照宽高比自适应">html 上实现 div 按照宽高比自适应&lt;/h1>
&lt;p>原理很简单，padding 的百分比是根据宽度作为百分比自动设置的，所以容器上使用&lt;/p>
&lt;pre tabindex="0">&lt;code class="language-less" data-lang="less">
.container {
height: 0;
padding-top: 114%;
.data {
width: 100%;
height: 100%;
}
}
&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;p>就可以了&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>一段从js数组中获取重复数据的代码</title><link>https://mizuka-wu.github.io/posts/%E4%B8%80%E6%AE%B5%E4%BB%8E%E6%95%B0%E7%BB%84%E4%B8%AD%E8%8E%B7%E5%8F%96%E9%87%8D%E5%A4%8D%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E7%9A%84%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81/</link><pubDate>Thu, 18 Oct 2018 11:12:53 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://mizuka-wu.github.io/posts/%E4%B8%80%E6%AE%B5%E4%BB%8E%E6%95%B0%E7%BB%84%E4%B8%AD%E8%8E%B7%E5%8F%96%E9%87%8D%E5%A4%8D%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E7%9A%84%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81/</guid><description>&lt;pre tabindex="0">&lt;code>
Array.prototype.duplicate=function() {
let tmp = [];
this.concat().sort().sort(function(a,b){
if(a==b &amp;amp;&amp;amp; tmp.indexOf(a) === -1) tmp.push(a);
});
return tmp;
}
&lt;/code>&lt;/pre></description></item></channel></rss>